Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Try a DBA combination to explore a different strategy type; seasonality dominates and the current leader uses trimmed mean (a robust mean).  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Seasonal dominance and unstable ranking suggest a simple robust aggregator; try median over full pool.  
