Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: test a different weighting scheme—softmax over inverse error—to see if a more balanced weighted combo outperforms the robust median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

Thought: Ranking is unstable and several correlated groups exist; a per‑horizon top‑k mean may capture complementary strengths.  
