Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using per‑horizon top‑k mean (w4) to see if horizon‑specific averaging improves over robust mean, given seasonal dominance and unstable ranking.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w4","rationale":"per‑horizon top‑k weighted combination"}

Thought: The ranking is unstable and several models are correlated; testing a metric‑ranked subset with a softmax weighting will give a different strategy type.  
Action: select_top_k  
Action Input: {"k": 7, "metric": "smape"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse‑error combination on the reduced, stable pool (pool4) to see if focusing on the top 7 models improves over the median leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

